  <Index>k__BackingField: 14
  <Title>k__BackingField: Refinery Row
  <Settings>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a4621c90bf8b4fb4f8d530d842f8c4a0, type: 2}
  description: A line of refineries feeds the Shadow's war machines. Burn the fuel depots, clear the convoys on the supply road and bring down the Refinery Guardian.
  introduces: Fuel tanks and depots explode and take their neighbours with them. Gunships hover and fight.
  hints:
  - 'Shoot a fuel tank next to other ground targets: the blast destroys them too.'
  - Collect the megabomb and save it for a crowded sky.
